{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2e319b5357f82463","name":"Shock Stick","source":{"id":"source:reference-2e319b5357f82463","title":"Shock Stick","revision":20944,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:51:12Z","sha256":"3098316f3020c0ad152bebc1ad2b08eca6d465d05460c1f05c628023d0620ede","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20944","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shock%20Stick&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2e319b5357f82463","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Shock Stick is a melee weapon that delivers a stunning blow to the enemy's senses. Using technology similar to that of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Baton"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Baton","referenceId":"reference:895573ffa7826a58"},", a Shock Stick has the added benefit of delivering its stunning energy in a rapid, overwhelming bust that can completely disable less hardy beings.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Shock Stick always deal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage. When a target susceptible to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage is hit by a Shock Stick, compare the damage (before halving) to the target's current ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"}," total. If the damage equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"}," total, the target moves -5 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," and is knocked unconscious. Otherwise, compare the result to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," and resolve the attack as normal.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Shock Stick requires an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate. Additionally, a Shock Stick can be mounted on a weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bayonet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bayonet","referenceId":"reference:a8f16c5b56fb4ef7"},". When a Shock Stick is mounted on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bayonet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bayonet","referenceId":"reference:a8f16c5b56fb4ef7"},", the wielder takes no penalty to attacks with the Shock Stick for not having the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Advanced Melee Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Advanced_Melee_Weapons)"}," feat, if the wielder is proficient in the Rifle's use.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 450\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," ONLY (3d6)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1.4 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
